#
# Scoped ignore-file for .clusterfuzzlite/Dockerfile.
#
# BuildKit uses a "<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore" file, when present, INSTEAD
# of the repo-root .dockerignore for that specific build. The ClusterFuzzLite
# Dockerfile does `COPY . $SRC/project`, so it needs the full source tree; a
# restrictive root .dockerignore would starve it. This file gives the fuzz
# build the context it needs while leaving the root .dockerignore untouched.
# It excludes only never-needed noise.
.git
.venv
dist
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
